@startuml
[*] --> Draft : Auto-generated from PR or created manually
Draft --> Pending_Approval : Submitted (Total > $10k)
Draft --> Approved : Auto-approved (Total <= $10k)
Pending_Approval --> Approved : Manager signs off
Pending_Approval --> Rejected : Manager rejects
Approved --> Dispatched : Emailed to Supplier
Dispatched --> Acknowledged : Supplier confirms receipt
Acknowledged --> Partially_Fulfilled : Some goods received
Acknowledged --> Fulfilled : All goods received
Partially_Fulfilled --> Fulfilled : Remaining goods received

Rejected --> [*]
Fulfilled --> Closed : Invoice paid & settled
Closed --> [*]
@enduml
